   "title": "morir → muerto",
   "body": "(Se) ha muerto, with or without se. Muerto always goes with estar. Me muero ('I'm dying') is a common reaction to embarrassment, laughter or disbelief.",
   "examples": [
    {
     "en": "He has died.",
     "es": "(Se) ha muerto."
